    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MCDONALD & ASSOCIATES - EXPERIENCED, PROFESSIONAL, TRUSTED - are pleased to offer to the market this Wonderful 3 Bed Semi-Detached Family Home situated in a Small Private Development of just 24 Units. Overlooking Green Area & Agricultural Lands, this Ideal Home is within Walking Distance of Portarlington Town Centre & All Amenities. \r\n\r\nAccommodation of this Super Property is comprised of Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Area, Utility Room & W.C. on the Ground Floor with 3 Bedrooms, Bathroom & En-Suite on the First Floor. \r\n\r\nThere is a Feature Solid Fuel Fireplace in the Living Room with Bay Window creating a Cosy Atmosphere. \r\n\r\nThe Kitchen/Dining Area overlooking the Sunny, Southwest Facing Rear Garden, has a Fitted Kitchen with Oven, Hob, Dishwasher, Fridge & Freezer. \r\n\r\nA Separate Utility Room with Shelving & Washing Machine accesses the WC & Rear Garden. There is also External Access to the side of the Property to the Garden. \r\n\r\nThe Entire Ground Floor has a Tiled floor throughout joining each room seamlessly to each other. \r\n\r\nOn the First Floor are 3 Good Size Bedrooms with 2 Double Rooms both with Fitted Wardrobes. The Main Bedroom has an Additional Space in the Bay Window suitable for a Dressing Table. It also has an En-Suite with Tiled Shower Area & Electric Shower. \r\n\r\nThe Family Bathroom has a Tiled Floor & Bath Surround. \r\n\r\nHeated by a Natural Gas Central Heating System, the Property also has Double Glazed Windows throughout. \r\n\r\nThere is Off Street Parking on the Driveway. \r\n\r\nServices: Mains Water, Sewerage, Electricity, Natural Gas & Broadband. \r\n\r\nThis Property could make an Ideal Family Home. Let's make it yours!\r\n\r\nBER Number 119790491. Built c. 2006."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room     - 3.831m X 3.384m.\r\nKitchen/Dining  - 3.954m X 2.819m.\r\nUtility Room      - 2.375m X 1.467m.\r\nWC                   - 1.451m X 0.959m.\r\nBedroom 1       - 3.477m X 3.219m.\r\nEn-Suite\t         - 1.795m X 0.983m.\r\nBedroom 2       - 2.359m X 2.236m.\r\nBedroom 3       - 2.985m X 2.894m\r\nBathroom         - 2.467m X 1.661m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Quality Built, 3 Bed Semi-Detached House situated in a Small Private Development of just 24 Units.\r\nWithin Walking Distance of Portarlington Town Centre & All Amenities. \r\nFeature Solid Fuel Open Fireplace in Living Room with Bay Window.\r\nLight Filled Kitchen/Dining Area with Fitted Kitchen, Oven, Hob, Dishwasher, Fridge & Freezer.\r\nSeparate Utility Room with Washing Machine has Access to WC & Secure, South-West Facing Rear Garden.\r\nMain Bedroom with Fitted Wardrobe & En-Suite.\r\nFitted Wardrobe in Bedroom 2.\r\nTiled Floor & Bath Surround in Family Bathroom.\r\nNatural Gas Fired Central Heating. \r\nPedestrian Side Entrance to Rear of Property.\r\nOff Street Parking on Driveway.\r\nServices: Mains Water, Sewerage, Electricity, Natural Gas & Broadband."
